.env
*.tmp
.DS_Store
__pycache__/

# The repo is private (verified 2026-08-28) and stays that way, so documents,
# scans and identity numbers are now welcome — see AGENTS.md. The document
# patterns that used to be ignored here have been removed deliberately.
#
# Live credentials remain ignored: git history is permanent, and a working key
# is exploitable by anyone who ever holds a clone.
*.pem
*.key
*credentials*
*secret*
*.token
